# POSITIVE witness for gates/cli_010_depends_on_declared.rq: a tcps-cli module
# whose dependsOnModule target is declared (typed tcps:Module) AND named
# (tcps:name present). Zero rows required. Synthetic bench module; the 豊田
# namespace is tcps: = http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/tcps-cli#.
@prefix tcps: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/tcps-cli#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

tcps:BenchProbeModule a tcps:Module ;
    tcps:name "benchi" ;
    tcps:order 99 ;
    tcps:dependsOnModule tcps:CargoTomlModule ;
    rdfs:comment "Synthetic conforming CLI module: dependency is declared and named." .
